<title>USA: Masco Corp Q3 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Masco Corp Q3 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>TAYLOR, Mich. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.51		    $0.39</p>
<p> Oper net		  81,800		   62,070</p>
<p> Revs		     843,000		  738,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 160,500		  159,300</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1995 results are from continuing operations and exclude $5,030,000 income from discontinued operations.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.32		    $1.19</p>
<p> Oper net		 211,800		  189,400</p>
<p> Revs		   2,394,000		2,173,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs			NA			 NA</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1995 results are from continuing operations and exclude $15.5 million income from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
